=== num-coerce-num-named
from: CSS::Properties 0.10.9 lib/CSS/Box.rakumod:48
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: param coercion Num()
--- code
sub box(Num() :$left = 0e0, Num() :$top = 0e0) {
    "$left,$top {$left.^name}"
}
